# A flag set in one mailbox has to be announced in all mail, not just
# be visible there when asked: the modseq advances in every mailbox
# that holds the message.
depends allmail
protocol imap watcher
receive 1
* OK [CAPABILITY IMAP4rev1 AUTH=ANONYMOUS AUTH=CRAM-MD5 AUTH=DIGEST-MD5 AUTH=PLAIN AUTH=LOGIN COMPRESS=DEFLATE ENABLE ID SASL-IR STARTTLS] imapscript.test.oryx.com Archiveopteryx IMAP Server (security checking disabled)
send 2
w1 login script script
w2 examine All
receive 9
w1 OK [CAPABILITY IMAP4rev1 ACL APPENDLIMIT=38400000 BINARY CHILDREN COMPRESS=DEFLATE CONDSTORE CREATE-SPECIAL-USE ENABLE ESEARCH I18NLEVEL=1 ID IDLE LIST-EXTENDED LITERAL+ MOVE MULTIAPPEND NAMESPACE OBJECTID QUOTA QRESYNC RIGHTS=ekntx SORT SORT=DISPLAY SPECIAL-USE STARTTLS THREAD=ORDEREDSUBJECT THREAD=REFS THREAD=REFERENCES UIDONLY UIDPLUS UNSELECT UTF8=ACCEPT WITHIN] done
* 20 EXISTS
* 0 RECENT
* OK [UIDNEXT 21] next uid
* FLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen)
* OK [PERMANENTFLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen \*)] permanent flags
* OK [UIDVALIDITY 1] uid validity
* OK [MAILBOXID (f...)] stable mailbox ID
w2 OK [READ-ONLY] done
use main
send 1
e select inbox
receive 9
* OK [CLOSED] I, missa est
* 20 EXISTS
* 20 RECENT
* OK [UIDNEXT 21] next uid
* FLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen)
* OK [PERMANENTFLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen \*)] permanent flags
* OK [UIDVALIDITY 1] uid validity
* OK [MAILBOXID (f...)] stable mailbox ID
e OK [READ-WRITE] done
send 1
f store 3 +flags \flagged
receive 2
* 3 FETCH (UID 3 FLAGS (\Flagged \Recent))
f OK done
use watcher
send 1
w3 noop
receive 2
* 3 FETCH (UID 3 FLAGS (\Flagged))
w3 OK done
end
